# ---------------------------------------------------------------- tools
@weapon w.case
name: The claims case
class: shield
weight: 3
reach: 1
condition: 4
moves: block, catch, bash, heavy_bash
guise: shelf
needs: coat 1
scale: pride strong, formletter slight
special: brace
fittings: brass_corners | oilcloth | arm_strap

@weapon w.stick
name: The Vane's folding stick
class: light
weight: 1
reach: 1
condition: 2
moves: light_chain, flick
needs: none
scale: sum fair, dark slight
special: weathercock
fittings: tin_tip | weighted_knob | cord_loop

@weapon w.boathook
name: A boathook
class: long
weight: 4
reach: 3
condition: 3
moves: thrust, heavy_pull
guise: floor
needs: coat 2
scale: grip fair, salt fair
special: haul
fittings: barbed_hook | cork_float | short_haft

@weapon w.pole
name: A Lamplighter's brass pole
class: long
weight: 4
reach: 3
condition: 4
moves: thrust, sweep
guise: lamplighter
needs: coat 3
scale: ballast fair, formletter slight
special: ring
fittings: tin_cap | lantern_hook | split_end

@weapon w.knife
name: A gutting knife
class: short
weight: 1
reach: 1
condition: 3
moves: light_chain, slash
guise: guild
needs: nose 3
scale: dark strong, grip slight
special: open
fittings: oiled_edge | eelskin_grip | hooked_blade

@weapon w.hammer
name: The weigh-house lump hammer
class: heavy
weight: 6
reach: 1
condition: 5
moves: heavy, charged_heavy
needs: coat 5
scale: grip strong, ballast fair
special: break
fittings: weighted_head | short_haft | tarred_grip

@item w.boathook
name: A boathook
slot: hand
about: Reach and a hook. A heavy pulls a person off their feet.

@item w.pole
name: A Lamplighter's brass pole
slot: hand
about: Municipal property. The Trust notices it in other hands.

@item w.knife
name: A gutting knife
slot: hand
about: Quick and cruel. Carrying it changes how every faction reads Lamb.

@item w.stick
name: The Vane's folding stick
slot: hand
about: The Vane complains at every blow.

